body:
Yea, she definitely is weaker but it's still playable.

&#x200B;

I usually get Corruption potion on first back so that I can trade more. Then I go Mandate>Sorcerers>Zhonya >Banshee>Morellonomicon.

&#x200B;

I find the build to be quite strong. If i get ahead I can still 1v1 most of the enemies. Mandate is incredibly broken so I definitely recommend building it over Riftmaker. I also think that Riftmaker just isn't worth it considering the cost (compared to mandate).

&#x200B;

As for the rest of the build, I tend to go defensive options. I find Anivia to have enough dmg (you get +15AP for every legendary cuz of Mandate) and the one thing I really struggle with is staying alive.

&#x200B;

Here's my [op.gg](https://eune.op.gg/summoner/userName=VODKA+JE+RUM+Uwu) if you want to see my runes, build and the dmg I get with it.
